    + P22 \u2014 hai bi, m\u1ED9t n\u1EA5c cam v\xE0 s\xE2n chung ng\u1EAFn d\u1EABn
    th\u1EB3ng t\u1EDBi l\u1ED7.\nRecovery: T\xFAi gi\u1EEF hai ph\xEDa rack tr\xE1nh
    va ch\u1EA1m c\u1EA3n nhau; bi n\xE0o ra tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng thay
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng c\u1EE7a bi c\xF2n l\u1EA1i"
